    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A thirsty creator is craving your wishlist!</u> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join us\u00a0through discord\uff01And feel free to share any thoughts!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever dreamt of crafting your own business legend?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run an antique shop and cherish every treasure like a true lover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start from the slums and rise to become a business tycoon!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a humble street stall, negotiate with quirky customers, hire staff, and expand your empire through auctions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Know your customers:</strong><br>Are they wealthy? Can they spot the real deal? Or will they pay a fortune for fakes?<br>if a clueless rich fool walks in\u2014just double the price!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heads up!</strong> Not every &quot;antique&quot; is worth its glitter.<br>Cunning swindlers will sell you expertly forged fakes\u2014<strong>trust your gut before emptying your wallet!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Wait\u2026 This Can\u2019t Be Real!\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death note? Infinity Stones\uff1fExcalibur\u2026 <i>Seriously?!\u00a0</i>Will you recognize them all\u00a0<i>and say &quot;Wait, I remember this!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756160/extras/2046f5edfbef8680be69f69a054b61af.avif?t=1755584645\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Win Over Special Characters!\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help unique clients hunt rare items for juicy rewards!<strong>But\u2014</strong> <i>DO NOT</i> help &quot;Thanaos&quot; collect Infinity Stones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756160/extras/8ea5b9b051c8bf8fb9cbe7faeb9452ec.avif?t=1755584645\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No time to talk!\u00a0Start Dealing NOW!</strong></h2>",
